WEBVTT

01:35.990 --> 01:38.280
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.530 --> 01:41.110
[Episode 1]

01:45.150 --> 01:46.870
Wake up.

01:54.350 --> 01:55.350
My name is Yi Lan.

01:55.640 --> 01:58.840
Today is the first day
of my sophomore year of high school.

02:00.430 --> 02:02.290
This is my neighbor, Tong Xiaole.

02:23.560 --> 02:24.160
By the way,

02:24.560 --> 02:26.000
I'm also...

02:26.400 --> 02:28.710
an excellent cellist.

02:31.840 --> 02:33.170
Cutting it close again.

02:36.710 --> 02:37.520
Sister,

02:37.710 --> 02:39.960
are you going to a cello competition?

02:40.000 --> 02:41.120
No, no, no.

02:43.710 --> 02:44.800
Is Xiaole going with you?

02:44.800 --> 02:45.400
Yes!

02:48.120 --> 02:49.120
Hurry up and eat something first.

02:49.120 --> 02:50.120
There's no time!

02:51.430 --> 02:52.840
Why are you carrying your cello?

02:52.840 --> 02:54.840
For the school orchestra audition.

02:54.960 --> 02:57.360
You haven't even figured out your studies.

02:57.840 --> 02:59.370
-I'm leaving!
-Be careful!

03:00.430 --> 03:01.430
Coming! Coming!

03:03.280 --> 03:04.080
Let's go!

03:05.190 --> 03:05.960
Tong Xiaole!

03:06.520 --> 03:08.320
You're not waiting for me again!

03:09.100 --> 03:11.000
[Class 9, Grade 11]

03:11.080 --> 03:11.840
Just this one sentence.

03:11.840 --> 03:12.800
Remember this key point.

03:12.800 --> 03:14.330
Alright, class dismissed.

03:15.000 --> 03:17.530
Class Representative,
wipe the blackboard.

03:20.680 --> 03:21.430
Mr. Bu.

03:21.840 --> 03:24.150
Well, I've prepared my cello piece.

03:24.150 --> 03:25.430
When is the audition?

03:26.560 --> 03:28.280
There's too much on my plate
with the start of the semester.

03:28.280 --> 03:29.400
I forgot about that matter.

03:29.400 --> 03:32.000
Well, your application
was indeed submitted by me.

03:32.000 --> 03:34.079
But I'm not in charge of the orchestra.

03:34.079 --> 03:35.079
You know that too.

03:35.150 --> 03:35.840
They...

03:36.680 --> 03:37.680
Well, they...

03:38.310 --> 03:39.840
It seems they've chosen someone else.

03:39.840 --> 03:41.040
Chosen someone else?

03:41.800 --> 03:42.870
Who?

03:58.000 --> 03:58.560
Wait a moment.

03:58.560 --> 03:59.000
Um...

04:01.590 --> 04:02.560
Luo Ningzi?

04:02.960 --> 04:03.400
Mm.

04:07.430 --> 04:07.960
Go in first.

04:07.960 --> 04:08.590
We'll talk later. We'll talk later.

04:08.590 --> 04:09.120
Come! Come!

04:09.120 --> 04:09.560
Come!

04:11.120 --> 04:11.560
Come!

04:12.080 --> 04:14.000
Sorry to take up your break time!

04:14.080 --> 04:15.000
Go back to your seats, everyone!

04:15.000 --> 04:15.960
Sit down, everyone.

04:15.960 --> 04:17.240
Let me introduce someone to you.

04:17.240 --> 04:19.430
This is our new transfer student,

04:19.920 --> 04:20.920
Luo Ningzi.

04:21.600 --> 04:22.390
Luo Ningzi,

04:22.560 --> 04:24.420
introduce yourself to everyone.

04:26.480 --> 04:28.680
Hello, everyone, my name is Luo Ningzi.

04:29.190 --> 04:30.520
Give her a warm welcome.

04:36.190 --> 04:37.750
That should be the only empty seat
in our class now.

04:37.750 --> 04:38.630
Sit there for now.

04:38.630 --> 04:39.800
We'll rotate seats later.

04:39.800 --> 04:40.360
Okay?

04:42.750 --> 04:44.430
Help each other out, okay?

04:44.430 --> 04:45.430
-Okay.
-Okay.

04:46.750 --> 04:47.610
Chinese class.

04:59.560 --> 05:00.360
Class begins.

05:00.830 --> 05:01.360
Stand up!

05:01.830 --> 05:04.830
-Hello, sir.
-Hello, sir.

05:05.000 --> 05:05.530
Sit down.

05:34.560 --> 05:35.310
Lan,

05:35.430 --> 05:37.230
so you can't join the orchestra?

05:40.510 --> 05:42.240
She must have been handpicked.

05:49.000 --> 05:49.750
It's fine.

05:50.270 --> 05:51.830
She's going to the school orchestra later.

05:51.830 --> 05:52.560
I'll go take a look.

05:52.560 --> 05:53.490
I'll go with you.

05:54.630 --> 05:55.870
You guys plan to skip self-study class?

05:55.870 --> 05:56.750
Count me in.

05:57.270 --> 05:58.159
Xiaole, are you going?

05:58.159 --> 05:58.960
Are you going?

05:59.830 --> 06:00.830
I'm not interested.

06:00.830 --> 06:01.630
So I'll pass.

06:12.390 --> 06:13.190
We meet again,

06:13.390 --> 06:14.120
Tong Xiaole.

06:18.950 --> 06:21.390
The way Luo Ningzi looks at Tong Xiaole...

06:21.870 --> 06:22.870
Something's off.

06:23.870 --> 06:25.670
Did they know each other before?

06:26.310 --> 06:27.510
How is that possible?

06:27.560 --> 06:28.920
I grew up with Tong Xiaole.

06:28.920 --> 06:30.050
How would I not know?

07:05.070 --> 07:07.560
Why is Zhao Zhenghao so handsome?

07:07.950 --> 07:09.480
And he studies conducting.

07:09.830 --> 07:10.890
Don't you think so?

07:12.070 --> 07:14.390
She is indeed good-looking.

07:15.270 --> 07:16.510
And she plays well.

07:26.750 --> 07:28.880
Points-Deductor Hu will be here soon.

07:29.310 --> 07:29.870
Get lost.

07:44.630 --> 07:45.360
Director Hu.

07:45.950 --> 07:46.560
Director... Director...

07:46.560 --> 07:47.390
Director Hu. Director Hu.

07:47.390 --> 07:47.880
Director Hu.

07:47.880 --> 07:48.240
Director Hu.

07:48.240 --> 07:48.800
Director Hu.

07:48.800 --> 07:49.659
D-Director Hu.

07:52.510 --> 07:54.440
Tong Xiaole from Class 9, Grade 11.

07:54.630 --> 07:56.430
Chen Fan from Class 9, Grade 11.

07:56.510 --> 07:58.190
Yi Lan from Class 9, Grade 11.

07:58.310 --> 08:00.310
Qiao Mengmeng from Class 9, Grade 11.

08:00.310 --> 08:01.430
Qiao Mengmeng.

08:01.630 --> 08:03.870
These two strands of hair
on your forehead are too long.

08:03.870 --> 08:05.130
Cut them immediately!

08:05.310 --> 08:06.270
Yi Lan.

08:07.120 --> 08:08.070
You're at the bottom of the rankings.

08:08.070 --> 08:09.470
You're always involved.

08:09.750 --> 08:10.630
Chen Fan.

08:11.510 --> 08:13.370
Why wear glasses without lenses?

08:13.510 --> 08:14.800
And look at your clothes.

08:14.800 --> 08:15.680
Sloppy.

08:21.830 --> 08:22.630
Tong Xiaole.

08:24.950 --> 08:25.830
Top of the grade.

08:25.830 --> 08:26.720
Keep it up.

08:27.310 --> 08:29.040
Don't let them lead you astray.

08:30.000 --> 08:32.929
You three, each of you
loses one point for your class!

08:33.080 --> 08:34.960
The four of us are in the same class.

08:34.960 --> 08:35.720
I know!

08:36.080 --> 08:36.809
So your class

08:37.000 --> 08:38.059
will lose 3 points!

08:38.720 --> 08:40.120
I'll deal with you later.

08:47.080 --> 08:48.550
Points deducted again.

08:49.720 --> 08:51.600
What's wrong with having bad grades?

08:51.600 --> 08:53.440
Why didn't he scold Tong Xiaole?

08:53.720 --> 08:54.650
What did you say?

08:58.080 --> 08:58.910
It wasn't me.

09:05.910 --> 09:06.750
Where is he?

09:07.720 --> 09:08.920
Why isn't he here yet?

09:20.150 --> 09:21.280
What a coincidence.

09:21.440 --> 09:23.790
I happen to have a question for you.

09:25.240 --> 09:26.790
How did you know Luo Ningzi?

09:27.480 --> 09:29.080
Why have you never told me about that?

09:29.080 --> 09:30.840
She plays the cello so well.

09:36.600 --> 09:38.080
It's a bit windy today.

09:40.480 --> 09:41.740
I need to go home early.

09:42.480 --> 09:44.140
Are you going to tell me or not?

09:47.360 --> 09:48.440
Luo Ningzi and I

09:48.550 --> 09:50.150
met at a tutoring class.

09:50.480 --> 09:53.540
Just like you,
she's played the cello since childhood.

09:53.840 --> 09:55.790
She's taken part in many competitions.

09:55.790 --> 09:57.320
The only difference is

09:57.600 --> 09:59.930
she has won many national championships.

10:02.960 --> 10:05.320
Then why did she transfer to our school?

10:08.960 --> 10:11.790
Do you know the High School
Affiliated to Music Conservatory?

10:11.790 --> 10:13.080
It's full of talented people.

10:13.080 --> 10:14.610
The competition is fierce.

10:15.240 --> 10:16.960
Maybe she thinks it's...

10:19.080 --> 10:20.440
easier to apply for studying abroad
from our school,

10:20.440 --> 10:21.840
so she transferred here.

10:24.550 --> 10:25.720
If I get a chance...

10:26.240 --> 10:27.550
I must ask her for advice.

10:27.550 --> 10:28.680
Learn a thing or two.

10:31.200 --> 10:32.660
Learning to play the cello

10:32.670 --> 10:35.670
requires a good learning environment
and family support.

10:35.670 --> 10:36.440
It's okay.

10:37.030 --> 10:38.480
You've already worked very hard.

10:38.480 --> 10:39.280
You're great.

10:40.600 --> 10:41.270
I know.

10:43.600 --> 10:44.150
Let's go.

10:44.960 --> 10:46.790
The novel Shan ordered for me has arrived.

10:46.790 --> 10:48.550
Let's go to the musical instrument store.

10:48.550 --> 10:49.950
Alright. Get on the bike.

10:52.550 --> 10:53.440
Let's go!

10:55.910 --> 10:56.790
Tong Xiaole,

10:56.790 --> 10:57.850
what are you doing?

10:58.030 --> 10:58.550
You...

10:58.960 --> 11:00.080
Tong Xiaole!

11:05.550 --> 11:06.200
Miss,

11:06.360 --> 11:06.960
where is Shan?

11:06.960 --> 11:07.790
Shan went to restock.

11:07.790 --> 11:09.790
He left it on the fifth shelf for you.

11:39.550 --> 11:41.440
My dad is making me
something delicious tonight.

11:41.440 --> 11:42.790
Come to my place for dinner.

11:42.790 --> 11:43.360
No.

11:43.550 --> 11:45.210
I need to take photos tonight.

11:46.080 --> 11:47.200
Boring.

12:06.200 --> 12:07.150
Take photos. Come.

12:07.150 --> 12:07.960
Are we in the frame?

12:07.960 --> 12:08.720
Did you get the shot?

12:08.720 --> 12:09.550
Hurry, hurry.

12:29.760 --> 12:31.870
[Xiaole, I transferred you 1,000 yuan
for living expenses.]

12:31.890 --> 12:36.420
[Tell me if it's not enough. Your dad
and I will be home a few days late.]

12:42.890 --> 12:45.270
[My life's piece:]

12:45.290 --> 12:54.590
[Rachmaninoff's Symphony No. 2,
3rd Movement]

12:48.840 --> 12:51.570
It always brings tears to my eyes,
no matter when.

12:54.520 --> 12:55.240
Someone actually

12:55.240 --> 12:57.600
has the exact same life piece as me.

12:58.720 --> 13:00.650
If I could become friends with her,

13:00.960 --> 13:02.670
we could not only practice together

13:02.670 --> 13:04.130
but also talk about music.

13:04.670 --> 13:05.790
That would be amazing.

13:05.440 --> 13:08.080
[Nickname: Ning]

13:08.130 --> 13:11.140
[Friend Request] [Hello, I'm Yi Lan.]

13:11.220 --> 13:12.140
[Sending]

13:18.080 --> 13:18.550
Yi Lan.

13:19.670 --> 13:20.480
You're back.

13:21.030 --> 13:22.840
Did you skip a meal again?

13:24.440 --> 13:25.670
I brought you a feast.

13:28.080 --> 13:28.670
Let's go.

13:31.200 --> 13:32.000
Open the door.

13:41.960 --> 13:42.600
Tell me.

13:42.910 --> 13:44.640
Waiting at my door at this hour—

13:45.320 --> 13:46.240
did Uncle Dong

13:46.360 --> 13:48.620
tell you to stop playing the cello again?

13:54.960 --> 13:57.120
What life photos did you take today?

13:57.120 --> 13:58.080
Let me see.

13:58.440 --> 13:59.700
There indeed are some.

14:05.840 --> 14:06.970
Swipe right. Right?

14:10.240 --> 14:12.720
Your photography skills are amazing!

14:13.120 --> 14:14.840
Even better than the ones I see

14:14.840 --> 14:17.170
in professional photography magazines.

14:17.320 --> 14:18.850
Such a waste as just a hobby.

14:18.910 --> 14:20.960
You should participate
in a grand competition.

14:20.960 --> 14:22.600
Maybe you'll win a big prize.

14:25.200 --> 14:25.800
By the way,

14:26.200 --> 14:28.600
when will your parents
come back this time?

14:31.120 --> 14:31.790
They are

14:31.960 --> 14:33.560
focused on making money now.

14:33.600 --> 14:35.240
They deliver renovation materials
every day.

14:35.240 --> 14:37.970
They only remember
they have a son occasionally.

14:38.200 --> 14:39.670
Now I feel like

14:40.080 --> 14:41.680
I'm just a distant relative.

14:43.480 --> 14:44.960
You still have me.

14:44.960 --> 14:45.440
I'm

14:45.600 --> 14:46.720
just a call away.

14:47.080 --> 14:49.480
And don't be shy
about coming to my place for meals.

14:49.480 --> 14:50.740
We have plenty of food.

14:52.440 --> 14:53.480
And don't always

14:53.600 --> 14:54.720
ride your bike

14:54.720 --> 14:56.200
all alone.

14:56.240 --> 14:57.480
Take me with you.

14:59.910 --> 15:00.910
I'll consider it.

15:08.390 --> 15:12.400
[Ning
Friend request rejected]

15:10.320 --> 15:12.520
Luo Ningzi rejected my friend request.

15:12.960 --> 15:15.290
Why did you take the initiative
to add her?

15:15.960 --> 15:17.960
I want to play a cello duet with her.

15:20.440 --> 15:21.790
Then you deserve it.

16:35.440 --> 16:35.910
Mom,

16:36.440 --> 16:38.960
have you... and Dad eaten today?

16:55.410 --> 17:03.930
[Sleep on time.
Don't stay up playing games.]

17:19.140 --> 17:22.609
[Are you there?] [Yes.]

17:22.609 --> 17:30.310
[She really has been practicing hard.]

17:34.310 --> 17:34.920
Um...

17:35.310 --> 17:35.830
I...

17:36.880 --> 17:39.070
I think studies should come first now.

17:39.640 --> 17:40.350
Sorry.

17:45.370 --> 17:46.950
[Rachmaninoff's Symphony No. 2]

17:49.110 --> 17:50.640
-What are you doing?
-What are you doing?

17:50.640 --> 17:52.030
Don't distract me from serious business.

17:52.030 --> 17:53.090
Serious business?

17:53.350 --> 17:54.810
This is serious business?

17:55.830 --> 17:57.000
Stand here and keep watch for me.

17:57.000 --> 17:58.130
Don't let anyone in.

18:10.880 --> 18:12.350
Who is this letter for?

18:13.790 --> 18:15.190
You'll know soon enough.

18:18.240 --> 18:20.590
You're so eager
to join the school orchestra.

18:20.590 --> 18:22.400
Do you have a crush on someone?

18:25.160 --> 18:28.590
Who uses such a cheesy way
to confess nowadays?

18:27.550 --> 18:28.610
[Rachmaninoff's Symphony No. 2]

18:29.070 --> 18:30.330
You don't understand.

18:30.510 --> 18:31.830
I wrote this stroke by stroke.

18:31.830 --> 18:33.090
It's all from my heart.

18:33.480 --> 18:34.410
Cheesy, cheesy.

18:42.200 --> 18:42.750
Here.

18:43.750 --> 18:44.350
Someone's here!

18:44.350 --> 18:45.280
Hurry, let's go!

18:45.590 --> 18:46.270
Where to?

18:48.830 --> 18:49.400
Wait!

18:50.070 --> 18:50.790
Hide!

18:51.110 --> 18:52.110
Why hide?

18:55.270 --> 18:55.930
Luo Ningzi.

18:56.400 --> 18:57.550
You just joined the orchestra.

18:57.550 --> 18:59.310
It's okay if you don't understand.

18:59.310 --> 19:01.310
I've already found you a good partner

19:01.310 --> 19:02.570
to practice together.

19:06.350 --> 19:07.280
I don't need one.

19:08.310 --> 19:10.110
She really is quite cold.

19:13.160 --> 19:14.510
I'm the captain of the school orchestra.

19:14.510 --> 19:15.640
I have the final say.

19:17.030 --> 19:18.750
I have a fixed practice schedule

19:18.750 --> 19:20.080
and a practice teacher.

19:25.830 --> 19:26.630
What's wrong?

19:27.160 --> 19:28.560
Are you not feeling well?

19:31.590 --> 19:32.520
Someone's here.

19:36.030 --> 19:36.640
We're playing hide-and-seek.

19:36.640 --> 19:37.590
Can't you tell?

19:38.160 --> 19:38.920
Luo Ningzi.

19:40.000 --> 19:41.640
That video I sent you last night...

19:41.640 --> 19:42.310
I saw it.

19:44.830 --> 19:46.350
I know you two are very close.

19:46.350 --> 19:47.070
But with me,

19:47.400 --> 19:48.600
only ability counts.

19:48.790 --> 19:50.850
Her cello skills aren't good enough.

19:51.920 --> 19:54.250
She started playing at five just like you.

19:54.350 --> 19:58.680
She was the national cello champion
in the kindergarten category for 3 years.

19:59.240 --> 19:59.590
You don't have to

19:59.590 --> 20:01.400
act so high and mighty.

20:02.750 --> 20:03.550
So what?

20:04.590 --> 20:05.880
Things from childhood—

20:05.880 --> 20:07.510
how long will you talk about that?

20:07.510 --> 20:08.510
You know very well

20:08.510 --> 20:09.840
what her skill level is.

20:09.920 --> 20:10.880
I do know.

20:11.310 --> 20:13.510
She's the best in the world.

20:14.270 --> 20:15.510
Luo Ningzi?

20:16.270 --> 20:17.590
You've only been here for a few days

20:17.590 --> 20:20.320
and you already
know the top student of our grade?

20:23.110 --> 20:23.560
[Rachmaninoff's Symphony No. 2]

20:23.750 --> 20:25.720
This must be a love letter

20:25.720 --> 20:27.790
-Give it to me!
-for our boss from some girl.

20:27.790 --> 20:28.240
Give it to me!

20:28.240 --> 20:30.070
-I really like your performance
-Tong Xiaole, help me get it back!

20:30.070 --> 20:32.480
of Rachmaninoff's Symphony No. 2.

20:33.070 --> 20:34.000
Is it that funny?

20:37.350 --> 20:38.030
Junior.

20:38.220 --> 20:39.840
[To Luo Ningzi]

20:38.720 --> 20:39.960
Since you like me,

20:39.960 --> 20:41.310
just give it to me in person.
Why did you...

20:41.310 --> 20:42.310
It's not for you!

20:42.830 --> 20:44.430
-Narcissist.
-Narcissist.

20:53.480 --> 20:54.310
Thanks.

21:00.680 --> 21:02.110
But I didn't come to this school

21:02.110 --> 21:03.310
to make friends.

21:04.590 --> 21:04.960
[Rachmaninoff's Symphony No. 2]

21:07.770 --> 21:09.510
[Rachmaninoff's Symphony No. 2]

21:21.480 --> 21:22.680
It's easy to buy this.

21:22.920 --> 21:24.270
I can buy you a new one.

21:24.880 --> 21:26.280
It's not easy to buy this.

21:26.590 --> 21:27.310
This is a collector's edition record

21:27.310 --> 21:29.640
I've collected since elementary school.

21:39.350 --> 21:40.070
I'm sorry.

21:41.030 --> 21:42.230
I need to go practice.

21:42.830 --> 21:43.550
And...

21:45.400 --> 21:47.460
you've never heard me play in person.

21:47.920 --> 21:49.120
How can you assume...

21:49.240 --> 21:51.240
I'm not worthy of being your friend?

22:05.880 --> 22:06.590
Play.

22:17.350 --> 22:18.550
F-Fine, I'll play.

22:40.830 --> 22:42.360
Do you have the sheet music?

23:01.270 --> 23:02.590
Paganini's Caprices.

23:07.310 --> 23:08.960
Paganini's Caprices?

23:09.030 --> 23:10.000
They are very difficult.

23:10.000 --> 23:11.310
Can you play them?

23:32.790 --> 23:34.030
Do you have rosin?

25:06.030 --> 25:07.760
I'll definitely fix it for you.

25:10.110 --> 25:11.170
It's her. It's her.

25:20.720 --> 25:22.000
Don't bother fixing it.

25:22.000 --> 25:23.930
It definitely won't play anymore.

25:33.240 --> 25:33.960
Let me tell you.

25:33.960 --> 25:35.720
Luo Ningzi looked furious.

25:35.880 --> 25:38.940
If I hadn't stepped in,
they'd definitely have fought.

25:43.160 --> 25:44.720
And Yi Lan is really weird.

25:45.270 --> 25:46.800
She wrote a letter to a girl.

25:52.400 --> 25:54.720
But Yi Lan's performance
was indeed average.

25:54.720 --> 25:55.270
Yeah.

26:00.510 --> 26:01.370
Zhao Zhenghao.

26:03.030 --> 26:03.750
Sorry.

26:03.750 --> 26:05.440
I didn't expect to bump into you.

26:05.440 --> 26:06.750
We were just playing a game.

26:06.750 --> 26:07.750
I apologize to you.

26:07.750 --> 26:08.400
I'm sorry.

26:08.750 --> 26:10.160
I hope you can forgive me.

26:10.440 --> 26:11.960
Sorry. Sorry.

26:15.240 --> 26:16.070
What is that about?

26:16.070 --> 26:16.830
Strange.

26:24.270 --> 26:25.070
The machine is broken.

26:25.070 --> 26:25.930
Zhao Zhenghao!

26:26.640 --> 26:28.040
What are you looking for?

26:28.070 --> 26:29.310
Looking for this?

26:32.880 --> 26:34.110
-It's her?
-It's her.

26:34.270 --> 26:35.440
The one in the video.

26:36.590 --> 26:37.270
Is that her?

26:37.550 --> 26:38.270
It's her. It's her.

26:38.270 --> 26:39.070
What are you looking at?

26:39.070 --> 26:40.800
Go back to your own classrooms!

26:48.240 --> 26:48.920
Lan,

26:49.270 --> 26:51.870
the video of you
playing the cello is trending.

26:52.830 --> 26:54.270
Don't be too upset.

26:54.830 --> 26:57.630
Actually,
everyone really sympathizes with you.

26:57.680 --> 26:59.030
What's there to be upset about?

26:59.030 --> 27:01.400
I indeed haven't been playing the cello
as long as she has.

27:01.400 --> 27:02.400
Exactly.

27:02.680 --> 27:06.880
If you practiced longer, you definitely
would have played better than her.

27:17.480 --> 27:19.830
Let's go eat barbecue later.

27:20.030 --> 27:22.240
I found a place
that offers insanely spicy food.

27:22.240 --> 27:25.480
My treat—dinner, karaoke, claw machine.

27:26.200 --> 27:27.200
I'm not going.

27:27.590 --> 27:30.050
My dad asked me
to go home for dinner tonight.

27:30.070 --> 27:32.110
Mengmeng, I'm almost done.

27:33.000 --> 27:34.060
I'm leaving first.

27:34.310 --> 27:35.110
Have fun.

27:38.000 --> 27:39.060
I'm leaving first.

28:11.750 --> 28:12.950
Still not going home?

28:24.070 --> 28:27.070
I know. It's very embarrassing.

28:28.070 --> 28:29.680
I'm already so upset.

28:30.480 --> 28:32.540
Can you stop saying such harsh words?

29:06.070 --> 29:07.000
This time...

29:07.680 --> 29:09.550
what wish do you want to write?

29:10.420 --> 29:13.100
[Everyone, just forget it.]

29:13.200 --> 29:15.720
Writing wishes on candy wrappers

29:15.720 --> 29:17.590
is just a marketing gimmick.

29:17.590 --> 29:18.850
None of your business!

29:32.960 --> 29:34.070
It will come true!

29:43.720 --> 29:44.510
Tell me,

29:45.310 --> 29:46.830
do I still have a chance?

29:50.070 --> 29:50.930
How old are you?

29:51.680 --> 29:52.440
Fifteen.

29:52.640 --> 29:53.550
Exactly.

29:53.590 --> 29:54.720
You're only 15.

29:55.000 --> 29:56.440
Anything is possible.

29:56.440 --> 29:58.510
I'm 15, and she's 15 too!

29:59.030 --> 30:01.480
I'm working hard,
and she's working hard too!

30:01.480 --> 30:03.070
I'll never catch up to her!

30:04.240 --> 30:06.590
Who exactly is Luo Ningzi to you?

30:06.590 --> 30:08.920
Why do you
have to compare yourself to her?

30:09.960 --> 30:10.790
I envy her!

30:10.790 --> 30:11.880
I'm jealous of her!

30:14.350 --> 30:16.110
We both play the cello.

30:17.480 --> 30:19.960
Why is the gap so huge?

30:23.270 --> 30:25.160
I'm so envious.

30:25.350 --> 30:27.110
I'm so envious!

30:31.510 --> 30:33.510
I don't think the gap is that huge.

30:33.960 --> 30:36.550
Sometimes, I think
your performance is even...

30:36.550 --> 30:37.070
Shut up!

30:41.240 --> 30:42.070
I know.

30:43.920 --> 30:46.030
Jealousy is a terrible force.

30:46.720 --> 30:48.520
I don't want to be jealous of her.

30:48.790 --> 30:50.270
I want her to respect me

30:51.440 --> 30:52.720
and be friends with me.

31:06.070 --> 31:07.470
Which class are you from?

31:08.400 --> 31:09.240
Mr. Hu! Mr. Hu!

31:09.400 --> 31:10.270
-Run!
-What?

31:10.270 --> 31:10.880
Let's go!

31:12.070 --> 31:12.830
Stop right there!

31:12.830 --> 31:13.550
Wait for me!

31:13.550 --> 31:13.880
Stop!

31:14.510 --> 31:15.510
Wait for me!

31:20.460 --> 31:27.460
[Photographer]
